sentence_before:
Unlike conventional summaries, $R$ is an inspectable evidence package:
\begin{equation}
R=(I,G,A,P,H),
\label{eq:package}
\end{equation}
where $I$ contains selected visual evidence, $G$ grounded textual and temporal information, $A$ local measurements, $P$ provenance, and $H$ persistent retrieval handles.

