    \caption{Representation cost vs.\ editorial fidelity proxy across both benchmark families. Up and to the left is better. Cost is shown on a log scale; fidelity is each benchmark's own weighted proxy, not human edit preference.}
    \label{fig:frontier}
\end{figure}
Figure \ref{fig:frontier} illustrates the experimental cost--fidelity frontier in both benchmarks.

